hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"170","Allāhumma aghithnā, Allāhumma aghithnā, Allāhumma aghithnā. O Allah, send us rain; O Allah, send us rain; O Allah, send us rain."
"171","Allāhumma isqi 'ibādaka wa bahā'imaka, wa-nshur raḥmataka wa aḥyī baladak al-mayyit.. O Allah, give Your servants and Your animals to drink, spread Your mercy, and revive Your dead land."
